338
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:10,780
麦克斯 妙计啊
Max, that's brilliant.

339
00:15:11,220 --> 00:15:12,880
愿意买托托戒的人
If anybody's gonna buy a TAT ring,

340
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:14,260
早就都在这店里了
they're already in the store.

341
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:16,080
我们可以举办个快闪拍卖
We can have a pop-up sale!

342
00:15:16,446 --> 00:15:17,645
快闪拍卖是什么
A pop-up sale?

343
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,380
你不知道什么是快闪拍卖吗
You don't know what a pop-up sale is?

344
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:21,340
你还不知道什么是打火器呢
You didn't know what a pilot light was.

345
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,380
是一种新潮流
It's the new trend.

346
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:25,060
小店快闪出现 捞一笔
Mini stores pop up and sell stuff,

347
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:25,660
然后走人
then they're gone.

348
00:15:26,060 --> 00:15:27,260
这算什么新潮流啊
That's not a new trend.

349
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:28,900
八百年前毒贩子就这么干了
Drug dealers have been doing that for years.

350
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:34,140
一 二 三 四 五
One, two, three, four, five.

351
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,220
你干嘛呢 自闭小天才
What are you doing, beautiful mind?

352
00:15:36,420 --> 00:15:39,080
我在脑海里算着店里的摄像头的位置
I'm mentally scanning the layout of the store for security cameras.

353
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:42,020
小时候来这耍 不去公园玩果然有好处
I knew coming here and not going to parks as a child would pay off.

354
00:15:42,660 --> 00:15:44,760
好吧 只有一个地方可行
Okay, there's only one place we could pull it off

355
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:46,160
-那里没有摄像头 -哪里
- where there are no cameras. - Where?

356
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:48,520
卫生间里有快闪拍卖哦
Pop-up sale in the ladies' room.

357
00:15:50,259 --> 00:15:51,921
没错 女士
That's right, ma'am!

358
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:54,120
我说的正是卫生间里有快闪拍卖
I said pop-up sale in the ladies' room.

359
00:15:54,740 --> 00:15:56,020
我临阵发挥无能
I don't do improv.

360
00:15:59,700 --> 00:16:01,460
戒指成功卖掉了吗
So did we sell the ring yet?

361
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:03,780
刚那些女人不是我们的目标客户
Those women weren't our target customers.

362
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:05,960
我们要的客户群是很明确的
We're looking for a very specific type.

363
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:08,220
外表浮夸 钱包鼓鼓
Too much style and money to burn.

364
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,220
别关电梯门 小宝贝
Hold the elevator! Honey!

365
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,320
我爱死纽约了
and I love New York!

366
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:17,880
卫生间有快闪拍卖哦
Pop-up sale in the ladies' room.

367
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:25,180
我一次会带两个人进去看货
I'll take you in two at a time,

368
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:26,760
让我先跟我助手确认一下
let me go check with my associate.

369
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:29,040
然后就回来带安丁和露布鲁巴进去
And I'll be right back for Adin and Lublubah.

370
00:16:30,740 --> 00:16:31,880
记忆力不错
Such a good memory.

371
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:34,120
如此美丽的名字 过耳难忘
Hard to forget such beautiful names.

372
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:36,400
准备好了吗
Ready?

373
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:38,160
二号间里有人在拉屎
We have a pooper in stall two.

374
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:42,920
谁出门逛街还拉屎啊 有没有搞错
Who shops and plops? I mean, really.

375
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:45,380
真的 我闻到火柴味了
Trust me, I smell the match.

376
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,440
经典逛街拉屎除臭妙招
Classic shop and plop cover-up.

377
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,540
刚贩卖机买来的巧克力棒呢
Where are the two Kit Kats we got from the vending machine?

378
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,060
跟你说了我很饿
I told you I was hungry.

379
00:16:51,560 --> 00:16:54,060
阿拉伯女人购物习惯收赠品
Arabic women expect a gift when they buy something.

380
00:16:54,300 --> 00:16:56,860
或许能借二号间的蜡烛一用
Well, stall number two will probably supply a little present.

381
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:00,220
你也是来参加快闪拍卖的吗
Hi, are you here for the pop-up sale?

382
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,400
-不是 我是来尿尿的 -我的老天啊
- No, I just have to pee. - Oh, geez.

383
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:03,840
快去吧 别浪费我时间
Come on, don't waste my time!

384
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:05,660
一号间空着呢 要上快上 我们要做生意呢
One stall's open... in and out! Running a business!

385
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,800
那女人插队
That woman pushed ahead of us.

386
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,280
千万别把戒指卖给她
Do not sell her my TAT ring.

387
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:11,800
真有意思 你是来取货
It's fun. You're here to pick up.

388
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:12,820
她是来"泄"货
She's here to drop off.

389
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:17,020
开店咯
Open the shop.

390
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:18,540
我们是黄金搭档啊
We're a good team.

391
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:20,160
你负责下套 我负责"宰"人
You set 'em up, I knock 'em down.

392
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:23,320
-怎么会这样... -我也不知道 就是那样
- Why is...? - I don't know, it just is.

393
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,680
你们是来参加快闪拍卖的吗
Are you here for the pop-up sale?

394
00:17:25,979 --> 00:17:28,720
在厕所搞快闪拍卖
A pop-sale in the bathroom?

395
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:29,960
-太逊了 -超逊的
- So lame. - So lame.

396
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:32,500
-卡洛琳 -珍 罗宾
- Caroline? - Jen, Robin!

397
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:34,180
-天啊 -我的天啊
- Oh, my God. - Oh, my God.

398
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:36,740
-天啊 -我的老天爷哟
- Oh, my God! - Oh, my God.

399
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:40,000
抱歉 快闪拍卖什么时候开始
Excuse me. When will pop-up sale start?

400
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:43,100
我们三点在四季酒店预约了午餐
We have lunch reservations for five at Four Seasons at 3:00.

401
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:45,180
你怎么会问我呢
Why are you asking me?

402
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:47,380
不是你俩在搞快闪拍卖吗
You two are doing pop-up sale, no?

403
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:49,200
不是
No.

404
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:52,880
我跟这个厕所快闪拍卖一点关系都没有
I have nothing to do with this pop-up sale in the bathroom.

405
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,820
-太逊了 -超逊的
- So lame. - So lame.

406
00:17:54,820 --> 00:17:55,520
逊爆了
So lame!

407
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:56,740
是很逊啊
So lame.

408
00:17:57,060 --> 00:17:58,220
跟我们一起共进午餐吧
Come to lunch with us.

409
00:17:58,360 --> 00:17:59,399
我吃过了
Oh, I've already eaten.

410
00:17:59,399 --> 00:18:00,420
我们请客
Our treat.

411
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:01,840
你拒绝也没用
We are not taking no for an answer.

412
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:03,660
她们不让我拒绝
They're not taking no for an answer.

413
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:04,340
把戒指都卖了吧
Sell the ring.

414
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:08,560
她去哪里 你俩不是搭档吗
Where is she going? I thought you two were a team.

415
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:09,700
显然不是
Apparently not.

416
00:18:13,740 --> 00:18:14,540
太对不起了
So sorry.

417
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:17,440
沙拉太美味 我走不掉
I got caught up in a hostage nicoise situation.

418
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:18,440
卖的怎么样
How'd it go?

419
00:18:18,540 --> 00:18:19,580
戒指有全价出售吗
Did you get full price for the ring?

420
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,320
哎哟 您认识我吗
Oh, do you know me?

421
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:24,460
我清楚记得你跟我是陌生人呢
Because I could've sworn you didn't know me.

422
00:18:24,677 --> 00:18:27,369
我的新朋友安丁和露布鲁巴
My new friends Adin and Lablueballs

423
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,240
都纳闷你怎么突然抛下我走了
thought it was weird that you just bailed on me.

424
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:31,020
麦克斯 我一时慌了神嘛
Max, I panicked in the moment.

425
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,760
我不想她们到处宣传
I didn't want those girls telling everyone

426
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:35,340
说卡洛琳·钱宁在厕所里变卖首饰
that Caroline Channing was in a bathroom selling her jewelry.

427
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:38,280
我才刚从我爸的丑闻中慢慢振作起来
I'm barely back on my feet after the whole scandal.

428
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,940
再被人说 我就要受不住了
I just couldn't bare it.

429
00:18:42,660 --> 00:18:43,100
给
Here.

430
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:45,780
我没卖掉戒指 因为一开始我就不相信
I didn't sell them because I didn't buy the whole

431
00:18:45,780 --> 00:18:47,880
"你想和我一起做长远打算"的屁话
"in it for the long haul" thing from the beginning.

432
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:49,100
我就知道
And I was right

433
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:51,260
路遥知马力 日久见人心
because I'm always right about people in the long haul.

434
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:53,737
麦克斯 我在跟你说话呢
Max, I'm talking to you.

435
00:18:53,737 --> 00:18:55,984
不必 咱俩没啥可说的
It's cool. We don't need to talk.

436
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:02,360
麦克斯 戒指的事情是我对不起你
Max, about the rings, I'm sorry.

437
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:03,680
我不知道该说什么了
I don't know what else to say.

438
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:04,740
你什么都不必说
You don't need to say anything.

439
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:07,380
有关我们的未来之类的话 你说得够多了
You already said a lot of words about the future and us,

440
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:09,540
我还言犹在耳 你一句"我的老天啊"
and then next thing I know, you were "oh, my god!"

441
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:10,740
就丢下我 跟朋友吃饭去了
off to lunch with your friends.

442
00:19:11,340 --> 00:19:13,460
麦克斯 我真的想跟你做长远的打算
Max, I am in this for the long haul.

443
00:19:13,700 --> 00:19:15,580
我要怎么说你才能相信我啊
Isn't there anything I can say to convince you of that?

444
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,060
不用说 无所谓了
Nope. And it's fine.

445
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:18,620
跟你无关 是我的问题
It's not you, it's me.

446
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:21,460
怪我自己居然相信我们会有未来
I'm the idiot who actually believed for a minute that we had a future.

447
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,180
没事的
But it's ok,

448
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:25,360
像现在这样走一步算一步就好
we'll just keep getting by like we are, for the short haul.

449
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:26,440
好吗
Cool?

450
00:19:27,540 --> 00:19:28,220
麦克斯
Max.

451
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:41,760
-什么味道 -我在做小蛋糕
- What's that smell? - I'm making cupcakes.

452
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:45,920
-你点着烤箱了 -不需要 你看
- You lit the pilot light? - Didn't have to. Look.

453
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:51,629
不是吧 紫色的蓝色之星
No way! The Bluestar in purple?

454
00:19:51,629 --> 00:19:52,909
我靠... 它怎么会
What the... how did it get...

455
00:19:52,909 --> 00:19:55,000
怎么会... 你怎么买得起的啊
How can... how could you afford that?

456
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,940
-你把戒指卖掉了 -全卖掉了
- You sold your TAT? - Sold them all.

457
00:19:57,180 --> 00:19:59,820
拿来买了烤箱 请人隔天送货到府以及安装
Spent it on the oven, next-day delivery fee and installation.

458
00:20:00,180 --> 00:20:01,600
当铺的女人舍得给你好点价钱吗
That woman gave you a better price?

459
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:03,340
没有 她还拿枪威胁我了
No, she pulled a gun on me.

460
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,660
所以我走遍布鲁克林的当铺
So I went to every gold store in Brooklyn,

461
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:07,260
比较了它们的开价后
leveraged their offers against each other

462
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:08,340
终于凑够了钱买蓝色之星
until I got enough to buy the Bluestar.

463
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:11,040
你不需要这么做
You didn't have to do that.

464
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:13,560
在我做了那样的事情之后 多说无益
After what I did, there were no more words.

465
00:20:13,860 --> 00:20:14,920
只有烤箱能代表我的心
Only ovens.

466
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:18,240
我们的未来比过去的那些戒指更重要
And our future means more to me than rings from my past.

467
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:20,540
我说了 我要跟你做长远的打算
I told you, I'm in this for the long haul.

468
00:20:21,900 --> 00:20:24,960
顺带一提 我讨厌死跟那俩女的吃饭了
For the record, I hated lunch with those girls.

469
00:20:25,540 --> 00:20:28,740
我宁愿跟你在卫生间里分吃巧克力棒
I'd rather split a Kit Kat in a bathroom with you any day.

470
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:31,060
抱歉 我没在听
I'm sorry I wasn't listening.

471
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:32,580
我刚盯着我的新男友走神了
I was staring at my new boyfriend over there.

472
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,040
我要跟他亲热
I wanna make out with it!

473
00:20:37,688 --> 00:20:40,025
好烫
Ooh. Ow! Hot!

474
00:20:40,860 --> 00:20:42,220
不是真会"叮"一声吧
There's not a ding!

475
00:20:42,562 --> 00:20:45,115
的确会"叮" 我的戒指买了个"叮"
There's a ding. My rings bought a ding.

476
00:20:46,660 --> 00:20:48,140
你想拥抱我 对吧
You wanna hug me, don't you?

477
00:20:49,260 --> 00:20:49,780
是啦
Yeah.

478
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:53,460
-可你不会来抱 -我会
- But you're not gonna. - Yes, I am.

479
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:56,120
你要敢拉开老娘拉链 我打死你
If you unzip my shirt, I'm gonna be pissed!

480
00:20:58,600 --> 00:20:59,740
先夸你 再打你
Impressed, but pissed.
